{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方在西貢截查三部涉嫌超速駕駛的私家車，三名司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</p><p></p><p>昨晚十時許，警方於孟公屋村對開，截查該三部涉嫌在大拗門路超速駕駛的私家車。現場消息指，當中黃色跑車涉嫌以時速100公里行駛。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026edhEMHAz9n1791670817.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方拘捕三名涉事司機，經調查後，發現駕駛裝有定風翼私家車的司機涉嫌在網上發布危險駕駛片段。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-0100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026a1pB139mLd1791670810.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T22:37:55.738643+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}